<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who belong to one or more of the various Indigenous peoples of Australia; do not use to refer to the Indigenous people of the Torres Strait Islands, who are considered ethnically and culturally distinct. Only use to describe people who identify as Aboriginal Australian."@en .
