<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000349> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical and legal confinement of LGBTQ+ people in hospitals or medical institutions, typically to receive evaluation and treatment ordered by a court or other such authority. Can be used to describe both short-term or long-term institutionalization."@en .
