<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000352> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An umbrella term used to refer to people born with variations in their physical sex characteristics--including genitals, gonads, chromosomes, and hormonal factors--that do not fit typical definitions of male or female bodies."@en .
