<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000366> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Slang term used to describe people wearing masculine clothing, typically drag queens or crossdressers who also sometimes wear feminine clothing. Drab is a shortened form of the phrase \"dressed as a boy\" or \"dress resembling a boy.\""@en .
