<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marches, rallies, and other public gatherings focused on lesbian visibility, rights, and issues. This term should only be used to describe marches explicitly for dykes or marches centered on the dyke identity and politics. Otherwise, use the more general term \"Lesbian pride.\""@en .
