<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000384> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A largely reclaimed slur common in the U.S. that may be used to refer to lesbians who embrace a masculine style of presentation or lesbian political activists in general. Only use for individuals who self-identify as dykes."@en .
