<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eroticism"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000404> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The quality of being erotic, or causing sexual attraction, arousal, or desire. "@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000442> .
