<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who self-identify as lesbian and belong to lesbian communities. The term has been predominately used to describe women who are exclusively or primarily romantically and/or sexually attracted to other women. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian."@en .
