<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gaydar"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000559> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term describing a person's intuitive ability to identify others' sexual orientations."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001298> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000559> .
