<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender binaries"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cultural conceptions of gender as two distinct and opposing categories, typically man and woman or masculine and feminine."@en .
