<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender diversity"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An umbrella term encompassing a range of gender identities."@en .
