<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender expression"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe the way individuals express their gender identity through their appearance and behaviors, including gestures, movement, dress, and grooming."@en .
