<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000570> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000570" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Genderfluid people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who identify as different genders at different times, including multiple genders at once or none at all. Only use to describe people who self-identify as genderfluid."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001378> .
