<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000571> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000571" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender identity"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gender-variant identity"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person’s experience of having a particular gender, which may or may not correspond with the gender or sex they were assigned at birth. Not to be used to describe solely women’s experiences or women’s studies."@en .
