<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000573> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000573" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender markers"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Markers used to designate an individual's gender on official documentation, including passports, birth certificates, driver’s licenses, etc. Different jurisdictions vary significantly in the number and types of gender markers they allow on official documentation."@en .
