<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000575" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender relations"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The culturally specific rights, responsibilities, and connections afforded to individuals or communities of one gender by individuals or communities of another gender."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000947> .
