<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000576" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender swapping"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gender roleplay"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A media trope (commonly used in fanfiction and fanart) in which one or more characters switch binary sexes (e.g., a cisgender man transforms into a cisgender woman), often temporarily."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000568> .
