<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001323> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000644> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/homonormativity> .
