<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000645> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000645" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Homophiles"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000645> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Outdated term for lesbians and gay men. The use of the word began to disappear with the emergence of the gay liberation movement of the late 1960s and early 1970s."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000878> .
