<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000645> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/homophiles> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000645> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
