<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sexual sterilisation"@en-gb .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Refers to any type of medical treatment that intentionally leaves an individual sterile or unable to reproduce. This term encompasses both voluntary and involuntary sterilization."@en .
