<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed toward intersex people or intersex variations. Intersexphobia can include the denial of the existence of intersex people, insistence that intersex variations should be forcibly \"corrected,\" stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence."@en .
