<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000669> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to refer to a wide range of variations in sex characteristics. The term \"intersex conditions\" is a pathologizing term used to mean people born with variations in their physical sex characteristics also known as intersex traits."@en .
