<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000672> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000672" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersex movement"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000672> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term for activism focused on the rights of intersex people and issues faced by intersex communities."@en .
