<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000692> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000692> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2024-01-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
