<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000744> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe the sexual identity of women and femmes who are romantically and/or sexually attracted to other women and femmes. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian."@en .
