<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbianism"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sexual orientation of women and femmes who are sexually and/or romantically attracted to other women and femmes. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian."@en .
