<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000803> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000803" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbophobia"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed towards lesbianism as an identity or lesbians due to their sexuality, perceived or actual. Lesbophobia can include denial of the existence of lesbianism, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence."@en .
