<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000884> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000884" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ imprisonment"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ imprisonment"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Confinement, including physical and/or legal restraint, of LGBTQ+ people by an institution or authority. Typically used to describe confinement to a public or private prison that is sentenced by a court within a penal system."@en .
