<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who have experienced incest and may or may not have survived; follow individuals' preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."@en .
