<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who are deprived of their liberty against their will by an institution or authority. Typically used to describe individuals sentenced to confinement in a public or private prison by a court within a penal system, but may also include people forcibly confined to hospitals and other institutions."@en .
