<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ intimacy"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ intimacy"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Feelings of close familiarity or connection between two or more LGBTQ+ people that can be romantic, sexual, or platonic in nature. Can be used to describe the particularities of intimacy as experienced by LGBTQ+ people, as well as the ways intimacy is discussed and expressed within LGBTQ+ communities."@en .
