<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Prizes or forms of recognition given in honor of influential LGBTQ+ writers or literary works featuring LGBTQ+ characters and themes."@en .
