<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ lobbying"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Actions taken by individuals or groups to influence legislative action (or non-action), policies, or decisions of government officials in favor of LGBTQ+ people, communities, or issues."@en .
