<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written requests for political or social action that are addressed to government officials or public entities and signed by numerous people; use in reference to petitions created by or addressing LGBTQ+ organizations, communities, and/or concerns."@en .
