<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Medicalization"@en-us .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Medicalisation"@en-gb .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001006> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process by which human conditions and experiences come to be defined and treated as medical conditions and thus become the subject of medical study, diagnosis, prevention, and/or treatment. Use in reference to non-medical problems, such as LGBTQ+ identities and practices, that have been wrongly treated as medical issues."@en .
