<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001009> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001009" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Men who have sex with men"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "MSM"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Men who engage in sexual activity with other men, whether or not they identify as gay or bisexual."@en .
