<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Micropenis"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Microphallus"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001014> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person born with a micropenis has a penis that is smaller than the typical size range for an infant. People may also develop a micropenis as a result of several different intersex variations. The size of a person’s penis does not generally affect its functionality."@en .
