<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Misandry"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hate or dislike of men or boys."@en .
