<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001016> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001016" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Misgendering"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001016> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The act of referring to a person's gender incorrectly, often by using pronouns they do not identify with."@en .
