<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001061> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Institutions or groups dedicated to research, education, policy work, and advocacy regarding human sexuality and sexual behavior, particularly to challenge taboos and encourage more open discussion of sex and sexuality within society."@en .
