<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001062> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Climax of sexual excitement, typically characterized by feelings of pleasure and physical sensations including rapid muscle contractions, higher blood pressure and heart rate, release of endorphins, and ejaculation."@en .
