<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001073> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who self-identify as pansexual, meaning that they are sexually attracted to people of all genders. Some but not all pansexual people also identify as \"gender-blind\" because gender is insignificant or irrelevant in determining their attraction."@en .
