<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001081> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An enduring pattern of desire for connection and relationships (romantic, sexual, or play) with people of specific identities or within specific relationship orientations (monogamy, polyamory, polygamy)."@en .
