<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pinkwashing"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001117> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A variety of marketing and political strategies aimed at promoting products, countries, people, or entities to LGBTQ+ people; using LGBTQ+-related symbols in order to be perceived as progressive, modern, and tolerant; and/or utilizing concern for LGBTQ+ people and rights to justify or deviate attention from settler-colonialism, genocide, invasion, and intervention in other countries."@en .
