<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Polyamory"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Practice of engaging in romantic, sexual, or play relationships with more than one person simultaneously, with the knowledge and consent of all parties involved."@en .
