<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Polygamy"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001124> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The practice of engaging in romantic, sexual, or play relationships where the dominant partner has multiple spouses, though these marriages are not always recognized by law or within society."@en .
