<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001134> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/progestinInducedVirilization> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001134> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001134> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2024-01-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
