<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001135> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Words used in place of a noun. Typically used in the context of \"personal pronouns,\" or pronouns used to describe people (e.g., she, he, they, ze)."@en .
