<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001219> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Field of critical theory that emerged in the 1990s out of queer studies and women's studies. Queer theory involves the study and theorization of gender and sexual practices and identities that exist outside of heterosexuality and which challenge heteronormativity and essentialism."@en .
