<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Shared motherhood"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical procedure in which the egg of one partner is fertilized with donor sperm and then transferred to the uterus of the other partner to bring to term."@en .
