<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001488> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001896> .
