<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001300> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An enduring pattern of sexual attraction towards a certain sex or multiple sexes, as well as characterizations, objects, situational fantasies, or behaviors; generally understood to be either or both biologically determined and culturally and/or sociologically dictated."@en .
