<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001303> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Social perspective from the 1960s into the 1970s that challenged traditional codes of behavior related to sexuality and interpersonal relationships throughout the Western world."@en .
