<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001353> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Slang term for individuals who alternate between being the giving partner and the receiving partner in sexual encounters; typically used as a noun (e.g., \"They're a switch\")."@en .
