<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001467> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed toward trans individuals (or others perceived to be transgressing gender norms) due to their gender identity and/or expression. Transphobia can include denial of the existence of trans identities, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence."@en .
