<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Women's music festivals"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001515> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Organized events typically lasting more than one day that feature performances by women’s musical groups and performers. Though centered on music, women’s music festivals may also incorporate aspects of lesbian and feminist culture by offering workshops, arts and crafts, and community resources."@en .
