<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "XAAB"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assignment of an \"X\" gender marker or \"X\" sex designation shortly after birth. It is uncommon for intersex people to be assigned intersex or X at birth.\r\n"@en .
