<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cheating"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Straying"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Adultery"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Infidelity"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Affairs"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Stepping out"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A violation of a couple's assumed or stated contract regarding emotional and/or sexual exclusivity. Should not be used to refer to non-monogamy in general, as cheating is possible in both monogamous and non-monogamous relationships."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85001045> .
