<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compersion"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The positive emotion an individual may experience in regards to their partner's relationship with another partner. Often defined as the opposite of jealousy."@en .
