<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001663> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Polyamorous people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001663> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who engage in romantic, sexual, or play relationships with more than one person simultaneously, with the knowledge and consent of all parties involved."@en .
