<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In polyamory circles, this term refers to the practice of engaging in multiple-partner relationships that are \"closed off\" to new participants per the agreement of those involved."@en .
