<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Relationship anarchists"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who practice a type of non-monogamy characterized by application of anarchist principles (such as autonomy, anti-normativity, anti-hierarchical practices, refusal of state governance) to relationships. Often contrasted with hierarchical polyamory."@en .
