<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Xenogender identity"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Non-binary gender identity that is not defined in relation to human understandings of gender (i.e., female or male, woman or man), but instead in relation to animals, plants, or other things"@en .
