<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Xenogender people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person who identifies their gender in relation to non-human understandings of gender and relates to animals, plants, or other things."@en .
