<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001782> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Black queer people who recognize their queer identity as salient to their Blackness and vice versa; only use to describe individuals who identify as Blaqueer or BlaQ."@en .
