<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Passing (Sexuality)"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Passing (Sexual identity)"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Passing (Sexual orientation)"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001901> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ability of a person who is not heterosexual to \"pass,\" or be accepted or regarded as heterosexual by others. \"Passing\" has historically been used to describe an individual's ability to \"pass\" as a certain race or ethnicity, though the term was later appropriated by the LGBTQ+ community."@en .
