<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "cART"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001981> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Treatment that involves the use of three or more drugs in combination to treat HIV infection by preventing the virus from making copies of itself in the body; can lessen the damage to the immune system caused by HIV, slow down the development of AIDS, and prevent the transmission of HIV to others."@en .
