<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asexual people in the workplace"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002037> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The presence of asexual people in the workplace, including acceptance of and issues faced by asexual workers."@en .
