<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002039" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminist theory"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Feminist philosophy"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Theory of feminism"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The extension of feminism into theoretical, fictional, or philosophical discourse, often seeking to understand the nature of gender inequity."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001365> .
