<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Furries"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002165> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who are interested in anthropomorphized animals, as well as fiction and artwork featuring anthropomorphized animals. Many furries identify with anthropomorphized animal versions of themselves, which are called fursonas."@en .
