<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002192> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002192" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queer coding"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Queercoding"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002192> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Purposeful subtextual coding of a character or relationship in a piece of media as queer. Queer coding is distinct from the practice of queerbaiting in that the queer codes are intentionally present rather than falsely implied and are not typically used as a marketing tactic."@en .
