<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002201> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002201" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Slash art"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002201> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Artwork depicting same-sex or same-gender couples that is usually erotic or pornographic in nature. Historically used for male-male couples only, but is now used more broadly; includes femslash art."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002155> .
