<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002203> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Slash fan community"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002203> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The fan community that focuses on, incorporates, or details relationships between two characters of the same sex or gender (usually fictional, with \"Real person fiction\" as an exception). Historically used for male-male couples only, but is now used more broadly; includes femslash fandom."@en .
