<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002230> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pejorative term used chiefly in North America to describe gay men (or men assumed to be gay) and insult their perceived femininity. Some gay men have reclaimed this term and use it to describe themselves. Not to be confused with Faeries, the queer spiritual group."@en .
