<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transfeminism"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Trans feminism"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002274> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "As defined by Emi Koyama, transfeminism is a movement by and for trans woman who view the liberation of trans women as essential to the liberation of all women."@en .
