<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002277> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002277" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sapphics"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sapphists"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002277> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Women and, in some definitions, non-binary people of any sexual identity or sexuality who are attracted to women. Some but not all sapphics use the term \"sapphic\" to describe their sexual identity or sexuality. Only use to describe individuals who self-identify as sapphic."@en .
