<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police interactions with LGBTQ+ people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police treatment of LGBTQ+ people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Policing and the LGBTQ+ community"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term including any of various forms of interactions between police and LGBTQ+ individuals or communities."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000068> .
