<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002376> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002376" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police harassment of Black LGBTQ+ people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against Black LGBTQ+ members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying."@en .
