<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Criminalization of existing or identifying as an LGBTQ+ person, being perceived as LGBTQ+, or engaging in any of various actions considered to be linked to LGBTQ+ status."@en .
