<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of same-sex relations"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Criminalization of acts considered to be sexual or romantic between individuals perceived as being of the same gender category in a given sociocultural context."@en .
