<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti-LGBTQ+ police raids"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ establishments"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ venues"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids to LGBTQ+ venues"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of establishments owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids."@en .
