<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002383> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2024-05-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002384> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002384" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ bars"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of drinking establishments owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> .
