<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ nightclubs"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of nightclubs owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids."@en .
