<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002588> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002588" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Culturally queer"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002588> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe the feeling shared by many people with queer parents or caregivers that they grew up immersed in queer culture, including queer traditions, celebrations, media, and language."@en .
