<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002619> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An umbrella term used to describe all methods of conception beyond sexual intercourse, including but not limited to donor insemination, artificial insemination, surrogacy, egg donation, and IVF."@en .
