<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000567> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002699> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-06-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002699> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2024-04-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002699> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002700> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002700" .
