<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002850> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002850" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asexual survivors of hate crimes"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002850> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asexual people who have experienced and survived hate crimes; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."@en .
