<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asexual victims of rape"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002855> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asexual people who have experienced rape and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."@en .
