<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Trans-exclusionary radical feminists"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gender critical feminists"@en .
