<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003278> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of consensual non-monogamy in which spouses agree to engage in sexual and/or romantic relationships with individuals other than their marriage partner, without regarding this as infidelity."@en .
