<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Turkey baster babies"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003501> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Babies conceived through at-home artificial insemination, specifically by injecting semen into one's vagina using a turkey baster. There is an extensive history of at-home artificial insemination undertaken by LGBTQ+ people, including gay men contributing semen to aid lesbian couples in conceiving."@en .
