<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender conversion therapy"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Conversion therapy for gender"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Conversion therapy for trans people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Conversion therapy for transgender people"@en .
