<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003612> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pop music created by LGBTQ+ artists, for LGBTQ+ audiences, and/or that expresses an LGBTQ+ sensibility."@en .
