<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Women's sexuality"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Female sexuality"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003613> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe the ways in which women experience and express themselves sexually, including the types of people and practices they are sexually interested in."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001306> .
