<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queer architecture"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Queer design"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003614> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A school of architecture that seeks to create spaces that critique normative conceptions of gender and sexuality."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002601> .
