<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Decolonial theory"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Decoloniality"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Decolonizing theory"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Postcolonial theory"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Postcolonialism"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003616> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A school of thought that rejects Eurocentric knowledge hierarchies and ways of being, including the presumed superiority of white Western culture."@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001365> .
