<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ History Month"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gay History Month"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An annual, month-long observance of LGBTQ+ history and related civil rights movements. The month in which LGBTQ+ History Month is observed differs depending on the country."@en .
