<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003658> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003659> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2023000451> .
