<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003693> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ safe zones"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003693> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Safe zones (LGBTQ)"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003693> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Public spaces designated as safe for, or accepting and affirming of, LGBTQ+ people, often by allies. LGBTQ+ safe spaces are sometimes identified through the display of stickers or placards."@en .
