<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003694> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Pandemic impact on LGBTQ+ people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003694> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "COVID-19 pandemic and LGBTQ+ people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003694> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "COVID-19 and LGBTQ+ people"@en .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003694> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The particular impact of the COVID-19 pandemic on LGBTQ+ people and communities, including changes in access to health care, intimate relationship dynamics and safer sex practices, financial stability, social connectedness, and mental health."@en .
